<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Bocimar TBN - 140,000 tonnes coal Bolivar/Rotterdam $5.40 fio 50,000 shinc/25,000 shinc 1-15/5 Intercor.</p>
<p>SKS Banner - 80,000 tonnes coal Davant/El Ferrol $7.50 fio 30,000 shinc/25,000 shinc mid April Carboex.</p>
<p>ORE - hANJIN tbn - 140,000-200,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba Bay/Kwangyang and/or Pohang $8.60 fio eight days 9-24/5 Posco.</p>
<p>Silvergate - 100,000 tonnes ore Narvik east/Dunkirk east $4.05 fio five days shinc ppt Sideco.</p>
</text>
